asgard-office (1.0.0) thor; urgency=low

  * Initial @DISTRIBUTION@ office productivity metapackage.
    Bundles LibreOffice (Writer / Calc / Impress) + GNOME integration
    shim + en-US Hunspell / Hyphen / MyThes dictionaries.  Depends on
    asgard-gnome-desktop so selecting this subcategory pulls the
    GNOME base set automatically.

